:["ALTER TABLE [dbo].[ReceteDetaylari]  WITH CHECK ADD  CONSTRAINT [FK__ReceteDet__IlacI__47DBAE45] FOREIGN KEY([ilac_ID])\r\nREFERENCES [dbo].[Ilaclar] ([ilac_ID])\r\n","GO\r\n","ALTER TABLE [dbo].[ReceteDetaylari] CHECK CONSTRAINT [FK__ReceteDet__IlacI__47DBAE45]\r\n","GO\r\n"],"metadata":{"urn":"Server[@Name='DESKTOP-4B27P5S']/Database[@Name='HASTANEYONETIM_DB']/Table[@Name='ReceteDetaylari' and @Schema='dbo']/ForeignKey[@Name='FK__ReceteDet__IlacI__47DBAE45']","object_type":"ForeignKey"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# [FK__ReceteDet__Recet__46E78A0C]"],"metadata":{"urn":"Server[@Name='DESKTOP-4B27P5S']/Database[@Name='HASTANEYONETIM_DB']/Table[@Name='ReceteDetaylari' and @Schema='dbo']/ForeignKey[@Name='FK__ReceteDet__Recet__46E78A0C']","object_type":"ForeignKey"}},{"outputs":[],"execution_count":0,"cell_type":"code","source":["ALTER TABLE [dbo].[ReceteDetaylari]  WITH CHECK ADD  CONSTRAINT [FK__ReceteDet__Recet__46E78A0C] FOREIGN KEY([recete_ID])\r\nREFERENCES [dbo].[Receteler] ([recete_id])\r\n","GO\r\n","ALTER TABLE [dbo].[ReceteDetaylari] CHECK CONSTRAINT [FK__ReceteDet__Recet__46E78A0C]\r\n","GO\r\n"],"metadata":{"urn":"Server[@Name='DESKTOP-4B27P5S']/Database[@Name='HASTANEYONETIM_DB']/Table[@Name='ReceteDetaylari' and @Schema='dbo']/ForeignKey[@Name='FK__ReceteDet__Recet__46E78A0C']","object_type":"ForeignKey"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# [FK__ReceteIla__recet__370627FE]"],"metadata":{"urn":"Server[@Name='DESKTOP-4B27P5S']/Database[@Name='HASTANEYONETIM_DB']/Table[@Name='ReceteIlaclari' and @Schema='dbo']/ForeignKey[@Name='FK__ReceteIla__recet__370627FE']","object_type":"ForeignKey"}},{"outputs":[],"execution_count":0,"cell_type":"code","source":["ALTER TABLE [dbo].[ReceteIlaclari]  WITH CHECK ADD FOREIGN KEY([recete_id])\r\nREFERENCES [dbo].[Receteler] ([recete_id])\r\n","GO\r\n"],"metadata":{"urn":"Server[@Name='DESKTOP-4B27P5S']/Database[@Name='HASTANEYONETIM_DB']/Table[@Name='ReceteIlaclari' and @Schema='dbo']/ForeignKey[@Name='FK__Re